    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000sr5z](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000sr5z) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 18.0 depth occurred on Apr 18 2026 16km S of Lahewa. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 1.2529 longitude 97.2066. It impacted 236798 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
